{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to LightQb</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>forced</strong> to take part in an experiment\u00a0<strong>you didn't sign up for</strong>. Trapped in an unknown space, you must dash and <strong>survive</strong> through a  grid-like world filled with <strong>light</strong>\u00a0<strong>cubes</strong>, each with unique mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/ef755b43832c223f0f8972456910b0cd.poster.avif?t=1756846625\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/ef755b43832c223f0f8972456910b0cd.webm?t=1756846625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time is your greatest enemy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cubes, lasers, and portals to your advantage as you blaze through levels at incredible speeds, but <strong>beware</strong>, there might be more to this world than meets <strong>the eye</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/bb707577c8a993918bbe15a66a28a3c0.poster.avif?t=1756846625\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/bb707577c8a993918bbe15a66a28a3c0.webm?t=1756846625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play, die and repeat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>cycle</strong> continues until you master your path to the end or give up. Oh, and did I mention there\u2019s someone mocking you every time you <strong>die</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/a8759bfc7f69e21f240b634a3da972c8.poster.avif?t=1756846625\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/a8759bfc7f69e21f240b634a3da972c8.webm?t=1756846625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3392840?t=1756846625","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756846625","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/ced2913761155e9cca9b0bf2dfaa162143c3352a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756846625","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/ced2913761155e9cca9b0bf2dfaa162143c3352a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756846625","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3395650,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to LightQb</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>forced</strong> to take part in an experiment\u00a0<strong>you didn't sign up for</strong>. Trapped in an unknown space, you must dash and <strong>survive</strong> through a  grid-like world filled with <strong>light</strong>\u00a0<strong>cubes</strong>, each with unique mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a